/rl2791670785"}, {"title": "The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water", "url": "https://www.boxofficemojo.com/release/rl1130726401"}, {"title": "The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water", "url": "https://www.boxofficemojo.com/release/rl2724561921"}]}, "The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water had its U.S. theatrical release on February 6, 2015. Crosswalk lists that date, and Box Office Mojo's international table gives the same domestic date. Box Office Mojo's entry shows an earlier debut in Belgium on January 28, 2015, so the film opened abroad before it reached U.S. theaters. Crosswalk also lists a home video (DVD) release on June 2, 2015."], "durationSeconds": 5.156527583999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01CznWpM351sbhJ7ZcQ9GCLR", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
