{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01L95NJzQx75DEstKC83t6jX", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anton_Grylewicz\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_members_of_the_Politburo_of_the_Communist_Party_of_Germany\"}, {\"url\": \"https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/137961/pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.jewishvirtuallibrary.org/jsource/judaica/ejud_0002_0011_0_10206.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.dhm.de/lemo/biografie/leo-jogiches.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.dhm.de/lemo/biografie/leo-jogiches\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.encyclopedia.com/religion/encyclopedias-almanacs-transcripts-and-maps/jogiches-leon\"}, {\"url\": \"https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/571384/pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marxists.org/espanol/levi/index.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://alchetron.com/Anton-Grylewicz\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:03:58.981Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Anton Grylewicz KPD politician 1885", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01WNMd61gQRjQMNiznwfjwLC", "content": [{"title": "Anton Grylewicz", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anton_Grylewicz"}, {"title": "List of members of the Politburo of the Communist Party of Germany", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_members_of_the_Politburo_of_the_Communist_Party_of_Germany"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/137961/pdf"}, {"title": "JOGICHES, LEON", "url": "https://www.jewishvirtuallibrary.org/jsource/judaica/ejud_0002_0011_0_10206.html"}, {"title": "Leo Jogiches 1867-1919", "url": "https://www.dhm.de/lemo/biografie/leo-jogiches.html"}, {"title": "Leo Jogiches 1867-1919", "url": "https://www.dhm.de/lemo/biografie/leo-jogiches"}, {"title": "Jogiches, Leon", "url": "https://www.encyclopedia.com/religion/encyclopedias-almanacs-transcripts-and-maps/jogiches-leon"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/571384/pdf"}, {"title": "MIA: Paul Levi  (1883 - 1930)", "url": "https://www.marxists.org/espanol/levi/index.htm"}, {"title": "Tripti Joshi (Editor)", "url": "https://alchetron.com/Anton-Grylewicz"}]}, "Anton Grylewicz (8 January 1885 – 2 August 1971) was a German communist politician, born in Berlin. He came from a working-class family and trained as a locksmith. He joined the SPD in 1912, then the USPD, and by the time of the fusion he was a leader of the USPD's left wing. He then became secretary of the KPD's Berlin-Brandenburg organisation.\n\nHe was involved in preparations for the failed 1923 uprising. He took part in the technical preparations in Moscow for the abortive 1923 uprising and was tried alongside Arkadi Maslow but was granted an amnesty.\n\nHe held several posts in the KPD and in parliament. Sources differ on his Reichstag dates. The infobox gives 27 May 1924 to 5 January 1925, while the article text gives 4 May to 20 October. He also sat in the Prussian Landtag from 1925 to 1928.\n\nHis later career was marked by factional conflict. When Maslow and Ruth Fischer were removed from the leadership of the KPD in 1926 he was removed from the Zentrale and was excluded from the party altogether after speaking for the Left Opposition. He then co-founded the Leninbund and led its Trotskyist minority."], "durationSeconds": 5.8298324589999995, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01L95NJzQx75DEstKC83t6jX", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDY2zPr6cpVTy8irJJJ1", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：130 年**\n\n- 安东·格雷列维奇（Anton Grylewicz，德国共产党政治人物）生于 1885 年 1 月 8 日。\n- 第二部海绵宝宝电影《海绵宝宝：海绵出水》（The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water）2015 年 2 月 6 日在美国上映。它 2015 年 1 月 28 日先在比利时上映，算出来也一样。\n- 两个日期都已过了 1 月 8 日，所以从 1885 年 1 月 8 日到上映日，满 130 年，按题目要求向下取整是 130。\n\n共搜索 3 次。\n\n依据：\n- [Anton Grylewicz – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anton_Grylewicz)\n- [Box Office Mojo – Sponge Out of Water](https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt2279373)\n- [Crosswalk](https://crosswalk.com/print/11726288)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1146, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6424, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1146}, "output_tokens": 350, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:04:03.462Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDY2z6z3eRLvBKVPp4sd"}
